From: =?UTF-8?q?Micha=C5=82=20=C5=BBygowski?= <michal.zygowski@3mdeb.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 14:53:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 154/158] src/sbom/payload-SeaBIOS.json: add the license link
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SeaBIOS is distributed under LGPL-3.0-only (COPYING.LESSER), but its
CoSWID tag carried no license information unlike the other open source
payloads.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Michał Żygowski <michal.zygowski@3mdeb.com>
---
 src/sbom/payload-SeaBIOS.json | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/sbom/payload-SeaBIOS.json b/src/sbom/payload-SeaBIOS.json
index e46ef459f4..f02dc4c306 100644
--- a/src/sbom/payload-SeaBIOS.json
+++ b/src/sbom/payload-SeaBIOS.json
@@ -13,6 +13,12 @@
       "summary": "SeaBIOS is an open-source legacy BIOS implementation which can be used as a coreboot payload. It implements the standard BIOS calling interfaces that a typical x86 proprietary BIOS implements"
     }
   ],
+  "link": [
+    {
+      "rel": "license",
+      "href": "https://spdx.org/licenses/LGPL-3.0-only.html"
+    }
+  ],
   "entity": [
     {
       "entity-name": "coreboot",
